     3443           v-qnty       = all-qnty
     3444           v-sum-sale   = all-sum-sale
     3445           v-sum-cost   = all-sum-cost
     3446           v-sum-del    = all-sum-cost - all-sum-sale
     3447         .
     3448         display stream outstream sym1 sym2 v-NameString sym3 sym4 v-qnty sym5 v-sum-sale sym6 v-sum-cost sym7 v-sum-del sym8 with frame f-doc.
     3449         down stream outstream with frame f-doc .
